                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-01-16">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 16, 1917</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to previous correspondence
                    concerning the export of flour by certain Chinese dealers in exception to the
